  "resolver_floor_observation": "The 22.1.7 Core declaration tree has no ComponentFactoryResolver; 21.2.23 still declares it deprecated. This contract imports neither. Both CDK minima expose the public three-argument DomPortalOutlet constructor and TemplatePortal lifecycle used by owned menu content.",
  "rationale": "Material16 menu content creates only TemplatePortal; its resolver was passed into DomPortalOutlet for component portals, which this class never creates. The existing owned implementation already omitted that unused slot. The verifier now authenticates the original seven parameters, retires only index1, and checks all six retained token identities/options normally. Actual caller-node anchors, template/container/injector scopes, public app/document identity, context replacement, reusable portal/outlet identity, pane movement, event counts, owned view teardown, borrowed lifetime and real detector scope execute. Fresh Angular builtin wrappers are proved by their node/view scope rather than wrapper equality.",
